    m_Modifications:
    - target: {fileID: 3898893744150321906, guid: ba3fadd0e56047649bee962ccff586dd, type: 3}
      propertyPath: m_text
      value: "Experimental Report No. 186\n\nThe specimen has been successfully completed.
        The amalgam of Hippocamelus bisulcus (Huemul), Coendou spp (Coendou), and
        Myrmecophaga tridactyla (Giant anteater) has given birth to a hybrid creature
        whose anatomy and potential exceed all prior expectations. Its composition
        makes it virtually unstoppable. A perfect aberration\u2026 worthy of my collection.
        It will be archived alongside the others, awaiting its final purpose."
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
